# Visual-regression baseline PNGs: a LOCAL artifact, not committed evidence.
# The plan asks P0.4 for committed REPORTS plus the baseline ledger row, and 28
# full-page PNGs is ~14 MB of binary that every baseline update would rewrite.
# The committed report records each snapshot's sha256, so the exact baseline a
# reading was compared against stays identifiable. Regenerate locally with
# `npm run gate:visual -- --update-baseline`.
.quality-evidence/visual-baseline/

# Staged builds the local quality gates audit. Generated by
# `node scripts/deploy-pages-local.mjs --check --stage DIR`; a copy of the site,
# never a source of truth.
_pages_*/

# Local secrets and runtime state. `.env` carries a real TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY and
# was previously untracked-but-committable: one `git add -A` would have published
# it. Ignored, never committed, never read by the static site (it is 100%
# client-side and has no server runtime).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local tool state and binaries that must never reach the deploy manifest.
.wrangler/
.workers/
__pycache__/
cloudflared.exe

# Desktop-agent and tool state that lives in the checkout but is not repo
# content. Untracked-but-unignored is the same exposure .env had: one
# `git add -A` publishes whatever is sitting here.
.abacusai/
.agents/
.freebuff/
.trigger/
.worktrees/
.launcher_pids.json
skills-lock.json
node_modules/

# Job results and measurements a local run writes for the Jev gate's evidence
# builder (scripts/run-tests.mjs, scripts/smoke/runtime.mjs,
# scripts/check-privacy-browser.mjs). A local measurement of THIS tree; in CI the
# same files are uploaded as artifacts and composed into the record there. Never
# committed, because a committed one would be a stale count by definition.
jev-artifacts/

# Local run logs from the deploy and smoke passes.
*.log

# Preserved copies of work this tree replaced — the unrunnable canvas heatmap
# rewrite is kept here rather than committed, so the replacement is auditable
# without shipping something that cannot load.
.backup/

# Local media scratch.
appdriving.mp4
